Conflicts: rpmini-launcher
Replaces: rpmini-launcher
Description: Home screen of the hako game console
 Lists the registered applications (/usr/share/hako/apps/*.app and, for
 development, /data/dev/apps/*.app), starts the selected one and comes back
 when it exits. Holding HOME closes the running application. The settings
 tab changes the volume, the screen brightness, the language and the time
 zone, shows system information and powers off or reboots the console.
 .
 Registers itself as the hako-app alternative, so hako-session starts it
 at boot.
